<h3><u>Sughra ki aa rahi thi sada</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p  'Times New Roman'; line-height: normal; font-size: medium; ""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">(Marjayegi sughra, ghabrayegi sughra) x2</span><br></p><span class=""Apple-style-span""  'Times New Roman'; line-height: normal; font-size: medium; ""><font size=""4""><p>(Sughra ki aarahi thi sada saath le chalo, sab ke liye karungi dua saath le chalo) x3</p><ol><li>(Aadi nahi safar ki agar Amma thak gayee) x2</li><p>Asgher liya karu(n) gi utha saath le chalo</p><p>sab kai liye karu(n) gi dua saath le chalo</p><p>(Sughra ki aarahi thi sada saath le chalo, sab kai liye karun gi dua saath le chalo) x2</p><li>(Akber ki deed mai(n) hai meri zindagi ka raaz) x2</li><p>Akber sai yu(n) karo na juda, saath le chalo</p><p>Sab kai liye karu(n) gi dua saath le chalo</p><p>(Sughra ki aarahi thi sada saath le chalo, sab kai liye karun gi dua saath le chalo) x2</p><li>(Bin maa kai hu(n) yateem hi samjho agar mujhe) x2</li><p>Allah karega sabar aata saath le chalo</p><p>Sab kai liye karu(n) gi dua saath le chalo</p><p>(Sughra ki aarahi thi sada saath le chalo, sab kai liye karun gi dua saath le chalo) x2</p><li>(Jungle main niklay dam to wahi(n) dafan kijiye)</li><p>Hargiz nahi karu(n) gi gilla, saath le chalo</p><p>Sab kai liye karu(n) gi dua saath le chalo</p><p>(Sughra ki aarahi thi sada saath le chalo, sab kai liye karun gi dua saath le chalo) x2</p><li>(Akber ko sehra chahe Sakina hi bandhle) x2</li></ol><p>De du(n) gi door se hi dua, saath le chalo</p><p>Sab kai liye karu(n) gi dua saath le chalo</p><p>(Sughra ki aarahi thi sada saath le chalo, sab kai liye karun gi dua saath le chalo) x2</p><p>(Marjayegi sughra, ghabrayegi sughra) x2</p></font></span></p>
                 